From: robot
Subject: [PATCH] laya serve: add --host flag

laya serve binds INADDR_ANY with no way to override it, so the
studio/REST API is reachable on all interfaces. Add --host <ADDR>
(default 0.0.0.0, keeping current behavior) so services can bind
127.0.0.1:

  laya serve --port 7171 --host 127.0.0.1 ...

Also prints the actual bind address in the startup banner instead
of hardcoded "localhost". Adds <arpa/inet.h> to the POSIX includes
for inet_addr.

Build-tested against ggmlc v0.9.7. Applies with patch -p1 from the
unpacked ${P} source root.

